## Acceptance criteria

- Coherent warm illustrated space, not copied reference artwork or a real-shop claim.
- Cake detail remains in both panes at existing mobile/desktop crop coordinates.
- Transparent windows and distinct parallax depths are preserved.
- Bell, keyboard, skip, touch, reduced-motion and failed-resource behavior stays safe.
- Real product assets, light-pink covers, sticky tabs and static backgrounds stay intact.
- No new image-tool views; the existing allowance is exhausted.

